                  "linkStyle": {
                    "inherit": true,
                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "Among the 2026–2027 Obama Leaders are:<ul><li>Members of parliament in Germany, Greece, and Türkiye</li><li>A city councillor from Niger</li><li>A municipal court judge in the Philippines</li><li>A social inclusion leader advocating for children’s rights in Albania</li><li>Organizers registering first-time voters in the United States</li></ul>But the power of the Leaders program isn’t in each individual Leader, it’s in the power of bringing them together.",
                  "fontSize": "16px",
                  "fontFamily": {
                    "label": "Georgia",
                    "value": "georgia,palatino"
                  },
                  "color": "#30332F",
